main idea is to create k size max heap to get
kth min element,and if other k to n-1 elements 
is lesser than the top one so pop and insert 
current, so that we can have smaller number
in the heap and heap itself is the max heap 
so the top always denotes the kth smallest.

create a max heap for k size elements by inserting first k elements

now for k to n-1 elements compare it 
with top of the max heap and if less 
then pop 
then push current element 

The idea is to insert the min than top 
so that we can have kth smallest 

